Subject: [PATCH] [PR #50897] Lookahead-aware prefix cache hashing

Upstream-PR: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/50897
Upstream-Commit: 7f7139246af9793d0cfb2a1be60068a5fba5604c
Integration-Base: 355553ac22dca4080929ea8f88a446f15df1f3ba

Preserve the draft-head/adaptive-depth tests and current upstream cache tests.
Retain the Mooncake partial-tail integration: lookahead proof replaces the
extra EAGLE margin, finished saves snapshot hashes, and store jobs pin all
boundary sources until completion.

Use the upstream drop_eagle_group_ids policy and lookahead-hash opt-out.
Retain #61012's shared replay_boundaries helper in core and Mooncake.
Preserve #61183's separation of KV-cache planning into kv_cache_planning.py;
keep the lookahead hash helpers in kv_cache_utils.py.
Use the current HiSparse/EAGLE gating and shared helper in kv_cache_utils.
Preserve upstream capacity-only Mooncake workers, sleep-mode declarations,
offload metrics, and Triton Mamba checkpoint helpers.

